config IGB_VFIO_PCI
	tristate "VFIO PCI live migration support for Intel 82576 (igbvf) VF"
	select VFIO_PCI_CORE
	default n
	help
	  VFIO PCI variant driver for the Intel 82576 (igbvf) virtual
	  function with live migration support (stop-copy and pre-copy).

	  The driver communicates with the emulated PF through a DVSEC
	  capability in VF extended config space to support migration.
	  It is intended for nested virtualization with QEMU's igb
	  device model.

	  If you don't know what to do here, say N.
